Subject: [PATCH 0982/3799] soh: rename func_808A3C8C -> BgMoriHineri_Twist

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: drives shape.rot.z from the player's distance along Z so the hallway appears to twist, and forces the CAM_SET_DUNGEON1 camera.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Mori_Hineri/z_bg_mori_hineri.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
